load @term/seed/structure/manifold
  find manifold

# A Lorentzian manifold: a manifold whose metric has one timelike and the rest spacelike directions, the geometry of
# spacetime in general relativity, where the interval can be positive, negative, or zero and light travels on the zero
# cones. It is the curved generalization of flat Minkowski spacetime. The form carries the underlying manifold; the
# one-timelike metric signature is the added structure.
form lorentzian-manifold
  link manifold, like manifold
